<title>USA: Huaneng Power plans $200 mln debt offering.</title>
<headline>Huaneng Power plans $200 mln debt offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huaneng Power International Inc on Friday said it has received approval from China to issue approximately $200 million in convertible debt securities in a public offering.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for its installed capacity expansion programs in China, Huaneng Power said.</p>
<p>The offering is subject to the approval of Huaneng Power's shareholders at a meeting slated for April, it said.</p>
<p>Huaneng Power owns and operates power plants in China.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
